{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_debugging_debugging", "label": "Arsenal de depuraci\u00f3n", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": "L1-L45", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_debugging_symptom_taxonomy", "label": "Taxonom\u00eda de sospechosos por s\u00edntoma", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": "L375-L388", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Empezar por la fila que describe el s\u00edntoma reduce el espacio de b\u00fasqueda al 20% m\u00e1s probable antes del primer experimento."}, {"id": "docs_debugging_bisection", "label": "Bisecci\u00f3n espacial y temporal (`git bisect run`)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": "L394-L395", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tres cortes espaciales reducen el espacio 8x, y git bisect encuentra el commit culpable en log2(n) pasos: el mejor ratio resultado/esfuerzo cuando hay una regresi\u00f3n."}, {"id": "docs_debugging_differential_debugging", "label": "Debugging diferencial", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": "L396", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Diffear todo lo que separa un caso bueno de uno malo y eliminar diferencias es m\u00e1s barato que razonar desde cero."}, {"id": "docs_debugging_heisenbugs", "label": "Heisenbugs y reproducci\u00f3n estad\u00edstica", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": "L399", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El bug que se esconde al observarlo es casi siempre timing: se instrumenta con m\u00ednima perturbaci\u00f3n y se mide frecuencia ('7/100 antes, 0/500 despu\u00e9s' es evidencia; 'no lo he vuelto a ver' no)."}, {"id": "docs_debugging_evidence_discipline", "label": "Disciplina de evidencia", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": "L402-L407", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Una variable por experimento, hip\u00f3tesis muertas registradas, y la causa debe explicar el 100% del s\u00edntoma: un candidato que explica el 80% es la causa equivocada."}, {"id": "docs_debugging_anti_patterns", "label": "Anti-patrones de depuraci\u00f3n", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": "L409-L415", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shotgun debugging destruye evidencia y curar el s\u00edntoma (try/catch que traga, retry, sleep) convierte un fallo determinista en uno intermitente en producci\u00f3n."}, {"id": "docs_debugging_read_the_full_error", "label": "Leer el error completo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": "L392", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La mitad de los bugs 'dif\u00edciles' est\u00e1n escritos en la parte del error que nadie ley\u00f3."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_debugging_debugging", "target": "docs_debugging_symptom_taxonomy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_debugging_debugging", "target": "docs_debugging_bisection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_debugging_debugging", "target": "docs_debugging_differential_debugging", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DEBUGGING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"sour